{
  "sn55.6:0.1": "Linked Discourses 55.6 ",
  "sn55.6:0.2": "1. At Bamboo Gate ",
  "sn55.6:0.3": "The Chamberlains ",
  "sn55.6:1.1": "At Sāvatthī. ",
  "sn55.6:1.2": "At that time several mendicants were making a robe for the Buddha, thinking that ",
  "sn55.6:1.3": "when his robe was finished and the three months of the rains residence had passed the Buddha would set out wandering. ",
  "sn55.6:1.4": "Now at that time the chamberlains Isidatta and Purāṇa were residing in Sādhuka on some business. ",
  "sn55.6:1.5": "They heard about this. ",
  "sn55.6:1.6": "",
  "sn55.6:1.7": "",
  "sn55.6:2.1": "So they posted someone on the road, saying: ",
  "sn55.6:2.2": "“My man, let us know when you see the Blessed One coming, the perfected one, the fully awakened Buddha.” ",
  "sn55.6:2.3": "And that person stood there for two or three days before they saw the Buddha coming off in the distance. ",
  "sn55.6:2.4": "When they saw him, they went to the chamberlains and said: ",
  "sn55.6:2.5": "“Sirs, the Blessed One, the perfected one, the fully awakened Buddha is coming. ",
  "sn55.6:2.6": "Please come at your convenience.” ",
  "sn55.6:3.1": "Then the chamberlains went up to the Buddha, bowed, and followed behind him. ",
  "sn55.6:3.2": "And then the Buddha left the road, went to the root of a certain tree, and sat down on the seat spread out. ",
  "sn55.6:3.3": "The chamberlains Isidatta and Purāṇa bowed, sat down to one side, ",
  "sn55.6:3.4": "and said to the Buddha: ",
  "sn55.6:4.1": "“Sir, 